title: Script_2_2
---
<<enum TypeOfCocktail>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case HighAlcohol>>
    <<case LowAlcohol>>
    <<case NoneAlcohol>>
    <<case NotMatch>>
<<endenum>>
<<enum Satisfaction>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case Fail>>
    <<case Acceptable>>
    <<case Perfect>>
<<endenum>>
// Declare the variable (set false by default)
<<declare $task_done = false>>
<<declare $type_of_cocktail = TypeOfCocktail.None>>
<<declare $satisfaction = Satisfaction.None>>
<<jump TestLoopPart>>
===

title: TestLoopPart
---
Owen: Can you make me a drink?
<<wait_for_task TaskManager>>
<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    Owen: WOW! this Great.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Owen: Hmmm..... it's Ok.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    Owen: Unacceptable YUCK.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<endif>>

Walter: Can you make me someDrink not like Owen. hahaha
<<wait_for_task TaskManager>>
<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    Walter: WOW! like old day.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Walter: Hmmm..... good but not perfect.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    Walter: Oh.... taste bad.
    <<Reset_Variable TaskManager>>
<<endif>>

NOW IT WILL LOOP
<<jump TestLoopPart>>
===